{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sMqVy4Umf91793322905.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>比亞迪股份盈利升兩成八。</p><p></p><p>上季賺100億元人民幣，收入增長一成三，至2,214億元人民幣，首三季賺223億元人民幣，倒退百分之4。期內政府補助減少五成一至8.2億元人民幣，不過非流動金融資產估值上升，公允值收益增長九成三，至逾10億元人民幣，而海外業務增加，應收帳也急升五成二，至逾564億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:21:57.638534+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:20:20.122806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T02:18:18.159957+00:00","content_hash":"0f07a91f075c7123ddf676f321db346d55f037cfd6800bd87548c9540e274413","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:21:57.638534+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}